sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant P as Platform
    participant I as Enterprise IdP

    U->>P: Start login
    P->>P: Generate state, nonce and PKCE verifier
    P->>I: Authorization request with challenge
    I-->>P: Callback with code and state
    P->>P: Validate state
    P->>I: Exchange code and verifier
    I-->>P: ID token and access token
    P->>P: Verify signature and claims
    P->>I: Fetch UserInfo
    I-->>P: Profile
    P->>P: Resolve tenant and identity binding
    P-->>U: Issue platform JWT
